OL,3,GNEWSAFourteen crews tackling fire at
OL,4,Aplastic factory
OL,5,
OL,6,FFourteen fire crews are tackling a
OL,7,Fblaze at a plastic packaging factory.
OL,9,FSuffolk Fire and Rescue Service was
OL,10,Fcalled to M&H Plastics on London Road
OL,11,Fin Beccles at 12:52 BST.
OL,13,FA spokesperson for the fire service
OL,14,Fsaid the unit was fully alight,
OL,15,Fmeasuring 40x90m (131x295ft), and was
OL,16,Fspreading to the next unit.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
