OL,3,GNEWSAFourteen crews tackling fire at
OL,4,Aplastic factory
OL,5,
OL,6,FCrews are being supported by colleagues
OL,7,Ffrom Norfolk Fire and Rescue Service,
OL,8,Fwhile firefighters in Essex,
OL,9,FHertfordshire and Cambridgeshire have
OL,10,Falso been made aware of the ongoing
OL,11,Fincident.
